  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 2, 'Importance of product master data'. Three columns. On the left, SUPPLY CHAIN PARTNERS: manufacturers, procurers, Ministry of Health / programmes, donors, shippers, regulatory authority, central/regional/district warehouses and health facilities. On the right, SUPPLY CHAIN PROCESSES: forecasting and supply planning, procurement, ordering/re-ordering, inventory management, distribution, dispensing, product recalls and finance/insurance. Arrows from both point into the central PRODUCT MASTER DATA column — general information, classification details, pharmaceutical information, logistical information and other information — which flows down through a medicine icon to Patients.",
